# Engenty module package (Level A). The platform loads the server + AI face from
# SOURCE via jiti at runtime, so src/, ui/, ai/ and loose root .ts files MUST
# ship — this is a blacklist that only trims non-runtime noise. See
# PLAN-module-packaging.md (Phase A1) for why this is not a `files` whitelist.
# node_modules is excluded by the packer automatically. Patterns use both a
# depth-anchored (**/) and a bare form so nested dirs (e.g. ui/dev/) are caught.
.turbo
**/.turbo/
dev
**/dev/
coverage
**/coverage/
__tests__
**/__tests__/
__mocks__
**/__mocks__/
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.tsbuildinfo
vitest.config.ts
